          "statement": "iOS source_pipeline portable_known_projection 的 8 个 Android 已观测 cases 逐字段完全一致，覆盖 search、详情缺失字段、目录排序与 typed issue、正文缩进和相对图片 URL。",
          "verified_by": ["swift-package-tests", "conformance-targeted"],
          "requirement_clauses": [
