          "statement": "Golden comparison 使用 canonical JSON 且差异以确定性的首个 RFC 6901 JSON Pointer 报错；缺 Golden、错误 fixture 绑定、摘要漂移和投影缺失均 fail closed。",
          "verified_by": ["swift-package-tests", "conformance-targeted", "android-intake-contract"],
          "requirement_clauses": [
            "REQ-ANDROID-SOURCE-PIPELINE-001#RC-01",
            "REQ-ANDROID-SOURCE-PIPELINE-001#RC-02",
            "REQ-ANDROID-SOURCE-PIPELINE-001#RC-03",
            "REQ-ANDROID-SOURCE-PIPELINE-001#RC-04"
          ],
          "knowledge_claims": [
            {"id": "BKC-SR-HTML-CSS-PIPELINE-001", "revision": 1}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-4",
          "statement": "所有请求通过 FixtureTransport，编译出的 method/URL 与 SourceLab case 对齐；404 用例保留在 transport 边界测试中，不进入 Android 未观测的 portable projection。",
          "verified_by": ["swift-package-tests", "source-lab-contract", "conformance-targeted"],
          "requirement_clauses": [
            "REQ-ANDROID-SOURCE-PIPELINE-001#RC-01",
            "REQ-ANDROID-SOURCE-PIPELINE-001#RC-02",
            "REQ-ANDROID-SOURCE-PIPELINE-001#RC-03",
            "REQ-ANDROID-SOURCE-PIPELINE-001#RC-04"
          ],
          "knowledge_claims": [
            {"id": "BKC-SR-HTML-CSS-REQUEST-001", "revision": 1},
            {"id": "BKC-SR-HTML-CSS-ERROR-001", "revision": 1}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-5",
          "statement": "Capability、Checkpoint 与 Pitfall 明确记录假绿根因、已覆盖行为、404 lane 边界和下一规则切片；不得把首个 HTML/CSS Golden 通过宣称为全部书源兼容。",
          "verified_by": ["memory-close"],
          "requirement_clauses": [
